{
  "version": 1,
  "meta": {
    "author": "theta",
    "date": "2026-02-19T12:00:00Z",
    "notes": "Initial welcome sequence v1",
    "locale": "en-US"
  },
  "flow": {
    "id": "welcome.flow.v1",
    "name": "Welcome Sequence v1",
    "default_delay_sec": 15,
    "retry_policy": {
      "retries": 3,
      "backoff_sec": 10
    }
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "welcome.step.001",
      "title": "Welcome to The Far Mine!",
      "body": [
        "Ho there, traveler! I'm Brewmaster Alehart. Grab a stool and a mug—ye're among kin.",
        "We keep the hearth warm and the banter warmer. Drop a quick wave in #tavern-talk so the clan can toast ye.",
        "React with :beers: to let me know ye've arrived, or just say aye."
      ],
      "cta": {
        "label": "Raise a mug",
        "action": "react",
        "payload": ":beers:",
        "optional_secondary": {
          "label": "I'm here",
          "action": "ack",
          "payload": ""
        }
      },
      "deliver_to": "dm",
      "channel_token": null,
      "delay_sec": 0,
      "conditions": {
        "requires_roles": [],
        "excludes_roles": [],
        "once": true
      },
      "tracking": {
        "event": "welcome.view.001",
        "properties": {
          "step": "001",
          "surface": "dm",
          "cta_action": "react",
          "cta_payload": ":beers:"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "welcome.step.002",
      "title": "House Rules: Short and Sweet",
      "body": [
        "We mine for fun, not fights. Be kind, assume good intent, and keep feedback constructive—specific, actionable, and about the work.",
        "Hate speech, harassment, and spam get the boot; report issues early.",
        "Full rules live on the bulletin. Read 'em before ye swing your pick."
      ],
      "cta": {
        "label": "Open full rules",
        "action": "open_link",
        "payload": "https://thefarmine.example.com/rules",
        "optional_secondary": {
          "label": "Got it",
          "action": "ack",
          "payload": ""
        }
      },
      "deliver_to": "dm",
      "channel_token": null,
      "delay_sec": 15,
      "conditions": {
        "requires_roles": [],
        "excludes_roles": [],
        "once": true
      },
      "tracking": {
        "event": "welcome.view.002",
        "properties": {
          "step": "002",
          "surface": "dm",
          "cta_action": "open_link",
          "cta_payload": "https://thefarmine.example.com/rules"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "welcome.step.003",
      "title": "Choose Your Path: Prospector",
      "body": [
        "Prospectors are our bold playtesters—first into new tunnels, first to spot loose stone.",
        "Want the @Prospector role? React with :pick: below and the bot will set yer badge. We'll ping ye for builds and queue ye for playtests in #playtest-queue.",
        "If reactions fail, holler in #project-orchestration and a guildhand will assist."
      ],
      "cta": {
        "label": "Become Prospector",
        "action": "assign_role",
        "payload": "prospector",
        "optional_secondary": {
          "label": "React :pick:",
          "action": "react",
          "payload": ":pick:"
        }
      },
      "deliver_to": "channel",
      "channel_token": "tavern",
      "delay_sec": 0,
      "conditions": {
        "requires_roles": [],
        "excludes_roles": [
          "prospector"
        ],
        "once": true
      },
      "tracking": {
        "event": "welcome.view.003",
        "properties": {
          "step": "003",
          "surface": "channel",
          "channel_token": "tavern",
          "cta_action": "assign_role",
          "cta_payload": "prospector"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "welcome.step.004",
      "title": "Sprint Focus: Mine L1 Slice",
      "body": [
        "We're carving Sprint 1: a vertical slice of Mine L1—enter, mine a vein, haul it home.",
        "Peek progress in #build-in-public; we share dailies, wins, and stumbles.",
        "Rituals: Mine Mood check and Hearthfire Roll Call at shift start."
      ],
      "cta": {
        "label": "View sprint board",
        "action": "open_link",
        "payload": "https://thefarmine.example.com/sprint-1",
        "optional_secondary": {
          "label": "Shiny!",
          "action": "react",
          "payload": ":gem:"
        }
      },
      "deliver_to": "dm",
      "channel_token": null,
      "delay_sec": 15,
      "conditions": {
        "requires_roles": [],
        "excludes_roles": [],
        "once": true
      },
      "tracking": {
        "event": "welcome.view.004",
        "properties": {
          "step": "004",
          "surface": "dm",
          "cta_action": "open_link",
          "cta_payload": "https://thefarmine.example.com/sprint-1"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "welcome.step.005",
      "title": "How to Give Rock‑Solid Feedback",
      "body": [
        "Post playtest notes in #playtest-queue. Use a thread per issue. Tag with [bug], [ux], [balance], or [praise]. We'll acknowledge within 4 hours during work cycles.",
        "Template: Title; Steps to Repro; Expected; Actual; Build/Branch; Attachments.",
        "No spoilers without tags; keep it kind and clear. Link related threads when ye can."
      ],
      "cta": {
        "label": "Open feedback form",
        "action": "open_link",
        "payload": "https://thefarmine.example.com/forms/feedback",
        "optional_secondary": {
          "label": "Copy template",
          "action": "ack",
          "payload": ""
        }
      },
      "deliver_to": "dm",
      "channel_token": null,
      "delay_sec": 15,
      "conditions": {
        "requires_roles": [],
        "excludes_roles": [],
        "once": true
      },
      "tracking": {
        "event": "welcome.view.005",
        "properties": {
          "step": "005",
          "surface": "dm",
          "cta_action": "open_link",
          "cta_payload": "https://thefarmine.example.com/forms/feedback"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "links": {
    "rules": "https://thefarmine.example.com/rules",
    "sprint_board": "https://thefarmine.example.com/sprint-1",
    "bug_form": "https://thefarmine.example.com/forms/feedback"
  },
  "channels": {
    "orchestration": "#project-orchestration",
    "tavern": "#tavern-talk",
    "playtest": "#playtest-queue",
    "build": "#build-in-public",
    "mod_lodge": "#mod-lodge"
  },
  "roles": {
    "prospector": "@Prospector",
    "guildhand": "@Guildhand"
  }
}